# `/memos/arx-ein/`

**Important**: AI agents do not edit this file without explicit instructions

## Summary

This directory is for arx-ein (Mycelithyl) and their coding agent(s) to store what's been working on, what to do next, and other random memos and notes during the development work.

In each subdirectory there are at least two files: `agent.md` and `human.md`.
`agent.md` works as an index or entry point for the agent, summerizes and points to other optional files that may emerge inside the directory.
`human.md` is for human (namely, arx-ein) to keep what they have in mind. Agents may read but may not write nor edit this file.
